 "description": "Prepare, decode, and verify an unsigned same-chain EVM ERC20 swap construction aid for the caller-owned EOA or Safe. The envelope's valid_until bounds freshness and is committed to the artifact digest; the signer account nonce is the on-chain replay boundary, and this tool cannot guarantee single execution. Returns ordered allowance-reset, approval, and call steps only; never signs or submits. Every envelope from this server is valid for 300 seconds from construction (valid_until); a stale envelope is refused by the verifier \u2014 request a fresh one.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
